{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Blanket Fort",
    "steam_appid": 3878830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878830/extras/f15c63e4ab15c103ba37f78750d2e316.avif?t=1753368786\" width=616 height=287 /></span><br>BLANKET FORT is a unique take on The Backrooms, where the player explores a deceptively cozy and nostalgic world of childhood wonder. Enjoy an adventure through a world of blankets, pillows, and silly characters in a warm, softly lit atmosphere. <br><br>EXPLORE a world characterized by a sprawling and eerie maze, accompanied by your favorite teddy. Crawl and squeeze your way into increasingly claustrophobic spaces. Discover, talk, and aid cuddly toys along your adventure through the fort. <br><br>CHOICES MATTER when you decide to keep or leave your beloved teddy behind. Be careful how far you wander, as his jealousy may grow, making your soft and safe world much more treacherous.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878830/extras/f15c63e4ab15c103ba37f78750d2e316.avif?t=1753368786\" width=616 height=287 /></span><br>BLANKET FORT is a unique take on The Backrooms, where the player explores a deceptively cozy and nostalgic world of childhood wonder. Enjoy an adventure through a world of blankets, pillows, and silly characters in a warm, softly lit atmosphere. <br><br>EXPLORE a world characterized by a sprawling and eerie maze, accompanied by your favorite teddy. Crawl and squeeze your way into increasingly claustrophobic spaces. Discover, talk, and aid cuddly toys along your adventure through the fort. <br><br>CHOICES MATTER when you decide to keep or leave your beloved teddy behind. Be careful how far you wander, as his jealousy may grow, making your soft and safe world much more treacherous.</p>",
    "short_description": "BLANKET FORT is a single player, first-person horror exploration game. Navigate a cozy maze of blankets and pillows which grow increasingly claustrophobic as you help plushies with their troubles but be careful - keep your favorite teddy close or he might get jealous. Don\u2019t get lost\u2026 or found.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
